# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client data and deliverables are deliberately NOT published.
# This repo holds modeling code and the dashboard only. The pipeline reads its
# inputs from the local output/ tree, which stays on OneDrive.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
raw/
output/
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.pkl
*.db
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# The dashboard's generated bundle is the one data file that ships: the app
# cannot render without it.
!app/src/data/predictions.json

